abstract: |-
  Need a simple icon visual indicator for bank-to-bank payment transfer? This
  project is the right place.

  Designed properly using goverment structure and transfer symbols as
  references, this icon is specifically created for payment interfacing usage
  (e.g. invoice or digital terminal). Under an open license, one can freely use
  it for one's project as long as you **DO NOT** alter the graphic file.

  If you need customization, please contact us.
